# Tactical-genome screen arm (log 2026-09-08): the standing base with
# spacing 180 -- each reserve unit gathers at its own golden-angle
# station 180 world units (three rally radii) from the rally post instead of
# packing into one splash radius, against the artillery that tops
# every Impossible death ledger. Stations are pure arithmetic on the
# engine id: no draw, held across samples. Every other line is
# byte-identical to the base.
